the family motto.</i>

333
00:18:39,421 --> 00:18:41,088
- It's bullshit.
- This isn't fair.

334
00:18:41,089 --> 00:18:42,798
[Jake] Okay, okay.

335
00:18:42,799 --> 00:18:44,633
Hey. All right.
How about this?

336
00:18:44,634 --> 00:18:46,802
